    "sections": {
        "description": "UltraPress is a lightweight and customizable multipurpose WordPress theme suitable for blogs, portfolios, business websites, startups, agencies, and WooCommerce stores. It is compatible with the WordPress block editor (Gutenberg) and popular page builders, including Elementor, Brizy, Beaver Builder, and Visual Composer. The theme supports custom logos, custom menus, featured images, widget areas, threaded comments, translation, RTL languages, responsive layouts, and extensive customization options."
